 h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/statistiki\">← <!-- -->Всички показатели</a></p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Региони</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">БВП на човек по области</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Колко се произвежда на човек във всяка от 28-те области.</div></div></div><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Подреждане за <!-- -->2024</h2></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">Най-високата стойност е <!-- -->5,3<!-- --> пъти по-голяма от най-ниската.</p></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Във времето</h2></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">Показани са трите области с най-висока и трите с най-ниска стойност. Всички са в подреждането отгоре.</p><details class=\"mt-3\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-sm font-semibold text-green\">Цялата история от <!-- -->2000<!-- --> г.</summary><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white mt-2\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div></details><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">По-високата стойност е по-добра за хората.</p></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Какво следва за хората</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Когато расте</p><p class=\"text-[15px]\">Областта догонва.</p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Когато пада</p><p class=\"text-[15px]\">Областта изостава и губи хора.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Свързани показатели</h2></div><ul class=\"grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/statistiki/household_income_regions\">Разполагаем доход на домакинствата по райони</a><p class=\"text-[15px] mt-1\">Доходите следват производството.</p></li></ul></section><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mb-10\">Източник: Евростат, набор <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/nama_10r_3gdp/default/table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">nama_10r_3gdp</a> (<a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/statistics/1.0/data/nama_10r_3gdp?format=JSON&amp;lang=EN&amp;unit=EUR_HAB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">заявката, от която са взети числата</a>).</p><section><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Още в „<!-- -->Региони<!-- -->“</h2></div><p class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[15px]\"><a href=\"/statistiki/household_income_regions\">Разполагаем доход на домакинствата по райони</a><a href=\"/statistiki/unemployment_regions\">Безработица по райони</a></p></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$--><a href=\"https://github.com/osaznatost/osaznatost-web/issues/new?labels=%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0&amp;title=%D0%93%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0%20%D0%BD%D0%B0%20%2Fstatistiki%2Fgdp_pc_oblasts&amp;body=%D0%A1%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fosaznatost-web.vercel.app%2Fstatistiki%2Fgdp_pc_oblasts%0A%0A%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%20%D0%B5%20%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%BE%3A%0A%0A%D0%9A%D0%B0%D